  "summary": "Malicious code in syft-acp-core (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook runs beacon.js, which collects the installer's hostname, OS username, and current working directory, hex-encodes them, and transmits them via an HTTPS GET to exzotiqq[.]com (port 443) in the request path. The package has no other functionality; its sole purpose is this install-time host-fingerprint beacon to the remote host.",
